====== D-Link DIR-685 ======

{{media:dlink:dir685:dir-685-console-large.jpg?400|D-Link DIR-685}}

The D-Link DIR-685 is some kind of high-profile product from D-Link, it is labeled an Xtreme N Storage Router whatever that means. It is based solely around the Gemini platform, and ARMv4 Faraday FA526 silicon design. It has the following features:


  * Router: WAN+4 LAN
  * 2x USB ports
  * Wireless card (this is by default a Ralink RT2880F mini PCI iNIC card currently **NOT supported by Linux** in any way)
  * Mini SATA drive bay
  * Small video screen (!)

No UART access is required to reflash this device: a recovery web server is available.
